      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Memory used can reach 10GB or more, and a worst-case restart may be required to destroy them.\nRAM should not be easily recommended.\nFor players who use it for daily exchanges beyond simple games,\nThere is still a problem that it becomes difficult to check SNS and share information using QUEST desktop browsing and OVR Toolkit.",
