      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally just hop worlds and explore so don’t really bother revisiting a world most of the time. I can easily see in a session I have like 3gb-4gb cached but I constantly have to clear cache and I play with friends so I feel like I have to remind them this too so I would appreciate to have options like clearing cache automatically ie past a certain number of visited worlds or time base after an hour etc or automatically on close. I dont have a storage issue but find it dumb to let a game keep so much cache of worlds I won’t visit again unless I deliberately clear it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
