  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-09-01T17:38:01.847Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is a simple proposal.\nAs an option, we suggest adding an option to release the RAM cache that you always have when you move the instance.\nThis will at least prevent memory growth.\nEven now, some cache is released, but it is not enough in an environment where the memory used by the browser (and discord) exceeds 3GB.\n\nIn addition, even within the same instance, you should be able to reduce the used memory to some extent by releasing unused avatar memory within an hour.",
